l8: $ G , k = ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∈ A × B $ by wcel_intro [l4, l7]
l9: $ G ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∈ A × B $ by isset_elim [l3, l8]

