l19: $ G , z ∊ A × B , z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ A , v ∊ B , w ∊ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , w = cpr u v ⇒ w ⊆ A ∪ B $ by subset_eq_l [l15, l18]
